BM25 scoring is independently implemented from the published Okapi formula.

The English stop-word list is sourced from stop-words 0.9.0 (NLTK English list).
See STOPWORDS-LICENSE.md.

Unicode transliteration data is from deunicode 1.6.2. The Go decoder follows
that data format. Original copyright and BSD-3-Clause terms are preserved in
deunicode-data/LICENSE.

Unicode word segmentation and English Snowball stemming are provided by the
Go module dependencies github.com/clipperhouse/uax29/v2 and
github.com/blevesearch/snowballstem, respectively.
